{
  "$schema": "https://mintlify.com/docs.json",
  "theme": "mint",
  "name": "Roomote Docs",
  "description": "Documentation for Roomote, the open, self-hostable platform for cloud coding agents.",
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "When an agent is asked to install or try Roomote locally, follow /self-hosting/agent-installation even though it is hidden from side navigation.",
      "Use the checked-in Docker Compose files directly on macOS, Windows, or Linux. Add the documented cloudflared Compose service only when a public HTTPS callback URL is needed.",
      "Set R_PUBLIC_URL from the generated trycloudflare.com URL, recreate the stack, configure provider callbacks from that origin, and open /setup.",
      "Keep .env.local and setup tokens out of source control and chat. Let the user enter provider credentials and complete browser authorization.",
      "Verify the Compose services, connect one repository, and run one small task before declaring the local trial complete."
    ]
  },
